From a932905820e625766d3722d01129785d0d464f95 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pokeheartgold-3ds <bootstrap@invalid>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 08:29:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] rtc: read the raw RTC words through OSSystemWork
 (SDK_PORT_3DS)

rtc_api.c addressed the three raw words the ARM7 fills by literal DS address
(0x027FFDE8/EC/EA, OSSystemWork.real_time_clock at +0/+4/+2). Patches 1301/1302
moved main and shared memory into the port's arrays, so those literals point at
unmapped host memory: the vendored test_arm7 test_rtc segfaulted on the first
RTC_GetDate.

Under SDK_PORT_3DS the macros address the same three words through
OS_GetSystemWork()->real_time_clock, which is where port_rtc.c writes the ARM7
reply. Offsets and types are unchanged, so the DS-shaped BCD decoding above them
is untouched. The Metrowerks build keeps the original three lines: gcc-10
-E -P without the macro is byte-identical.

Checked by vendored test_arm7 test_rtc (RTC_GetDate/GetTime/GetDateTime),
which segfaulted before this patch.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 lib/NitroSDK/src/rtc/rtc_api.c | 13 +++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 13 insertions(+)

diff --git a/lib/NitroSDK/src/rtc/rtc_api.c b/lib/NitroSDK/src/rtc/rtc_api.c
index ab0c2b9..7add202 100644
--- a/lib/NitroSDK/src/rtc/rtc_api.c
+++ b/lib/NitroSDK/src/rtc/rtc_api.c
@@ -29,9 +29,22 @@ typedef struct RtcWork {
 } RtcWork;
 
 // RTC registers as received from the ARM7 (BCD).
+#ifdef SDK_PORT_3DS
+/* SDK_PORT_3DS: these three words are OSSystemWork.real_time_clock (the same
+ * field port_rtc.c fills), but the DS build addresses the shared work area by
+ * literal address. Patches 1301/1302 moved main/shared memory into the port's
+ * arrays, so the literals point at unmapped host memory and the first
+ * RTC_GetDate read segfaulted. Go through OS_GetSystemWork(), as the port's
+ * ARM7 side does: real_time_clock is at +0x1E8, date at +0, time at +4 and
+ * status2 at +2. */
+#define RTC_RAW_DATE    (*(volatile u32 *)(OS_GetSystemWork()->real_time_clock + 0))
+#define RTC_RAW_TIME    (*(volatile u32 *)(OS_GetSystemWork()->real_time_clock + 4))
+#define RTC_RAW_STATUS2 (*(RtcStatus2 *)(OS_GetSystemWork()->real_time_clock + 2))
+#else
 #define RTC_RAW_DATE    (*(volatile u32 *)0x027FFDE8)
 #define RTC_RAW_TIME    (*(volatile u32 *)0x027FFDEC)
 #define RTC_RAW_STATUS2 (*(RtcStatus2 *)0x027FFDEA)
+#endif
 
 #define BITS(value, left, right) (((u32)(value) << (left)) >> (right))
 
